Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
---------------------------------------
Starting from upstream commit 92e640d, this fork changes, among others:

- Video export and preview decoding: sequential WebCodecs frame source
  (src/renderer/export-video-decoder.ts, src/renderer/media-texture.ts),
  encoder backpressure (src/lib/editor/video-export-encoder.ts) and the
  export loop (src/lib/editor/export.ts).
- Video-editing workflow: layer clips, cuts, ripple delete, audio clips and
  mixing, subtitles, lower thirds, preview proxies (src/lib/editor/clip*.ts,
  src/lib/editor/audio*, src/lib/editor/subtitles.ts, src/store/*,
  src/components/editor/timeline/*, src/components/editor/layer-clip-section.tsx
  and renderer/pipeline changes).
- Documentary finishing: vignette, letterbox, split tone
  (src/renderer/scene-post-process.ts), Color LUT layer
  (src/renderer/color-lut-pass.ts, src/lib/editor/cube-lut.ts), Ken Burns,
  house easing default, grain frame rate/hold.
- Branding, metadata and default copy.
- Removed upstream's community gallery, accounts/auth, database and Sentry
  integrations (src/app/api, src/app/auth, src/components/community,
  src/lib/community, src/lib/auth, src/lib/db, middleware, instrumentation);
  Cmd/Ctrl+S saves a .lab file instead of an account draft.

The full list of changed files is the git history of this repository after
commit 92e640d (`git diff --stat 92e640d`).
